# The follow-up shot, written as a swing of its own. GMS offers it during
# Piercing Arrow, Snipe, High Speed Shot and the cartridge -- a window the
# player presses inside of -- and none of those is a thing the fight has: a
# swing here is chosen by rate and lands whole. What survives is the cooldown,
# which is what actually paces it.
#
# Twelve strikes twice over rather than twenty-four: GMS states a Strike Count
# beside the attack count, and two bundles of twelve is what it fires.
#
# No hitbox at all in the client, so the stated ten stands -- the same case as
# Storm of Arrows, where a missing box means the count is the reach.
name: "Surge Bolt"
description:
  "Concentrate and deploy a powerful spirit arrow."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_MARKSMAN_V skill_order: 2 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_CROSSBOW
base_delay_ms: 480
cooldown_seconds: 20.0
max_enemies: 10
lines: 12
casts: 2
base {
  skill_pct: 9.10
  ied_pct: 0.50
  crit_rate: 1.0
}
per_level { skill_pct: 0.35 }
